    LLM: 'Game: Magarac. Type: Reaction/Matching. Rules: Pass cards left simultaneously. Collect four of a kind to trigger slam. Last to react gets a letter (M-A-G-A-R-A-C). Complete word = lose.',
    Player: "Pass cards left as fast as you can! Try to collect four of a kind, then SLAM your hand and yell 'Magarac!' Be the last to react and you get a letter. Spell MAGARAC and you're out!",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player to react when a set is completed.',
    gameplay: '1. Players simultaneously pass one unwanted card from their hand to the player on their left. 2. This continues rapidly until one player collects all four cards of the same rank.',
